tly, like a coal that remembers fire.\n\nDorian Ash and the wizard Old Fenwick grew old telling the tale, arguing over every detail, and the kingdom of Eldoria prospered. The prophecy, the elders admitted, had never named a chosen one at all. It had named a choice.\n\nThey came home to the kingdom of Eldoria in spring, when the orchards bloomed. The songs had already arrived ahead of them, as songs do, and every verse was wrong in the details and right in the heart.'}]}

